Review and explain this commission calculation.

Rep: {{ $json.repName }}
Period: {{ $json.period }}
Quota: {{ $json.quota ? $json.currency + $json.quota : 'no quota set' }}
Total bookings: {{ $json.currency }}{{ $json.totalBookings }}
Attainment: {{ $json.attainmentPct !== null ? $json.attainmentPct + '%' : 'n/a' }}
Base rate: {{ ($json.baseRate*100).toFixed(1) }}%
Applicable rate (after accelerators): {{ ($json.applicableRate*100).toFixed(1) }}%
Accelerator applied: {{ $json.appliedAccelerator ? JSON.stringify($json.appliedAccelerator) : 'none' }}
Total commission calculated: {{ $json.currency }}{{ $json.totalCommission }}

Deal-level commissions:
{{ $json.dealCalcs.map(d=>d.id+' '+d.name+' ['+d.dealType+']: '+$json.currency+d.amount+' × '+($json.applicableRate*100).toFixed(1)+'% × '+d.dealTypeMultiplier+' = '+$json.currency+d.commission).join('\n') }}

Return JSON:
{"calculation_summary":"2-3 sentences explaining the total commission in plain language for the rep","attainment_narrative":"how this rep performed against quota, in encouraging but honest terms","anomalies_flagged":[{"issue":"","deal_id":"or null if plan-level","recommendation":""}],"breakdown_explanation":"a clear walkthrough of how the accelerator tier (if any) was determined and applied","verification_checklist":["things payroll/finance should double check before payout"]}
